  m_text: "<u>Research and Development Guidance</u>\nMr. Gonzalez\n\n<u>Programmers\r</u>\nJoan
    Lazo-Fiallo\r\nKayrat Sarypbekov\r\nAntonio Quintanal\n\n<u>Models</u>\r\nKayrat
    Sarybekov\r\nAntonio Qunitanal\r\n\n<u>Game Design</u>\r\nJuanpablo Maldonado\r\nDerwin
    Alexis\r\nAntonio Quintanal\r\nMr. Gonzalez\r\n\n<u>Animation & Art</u>\r\nAlain
    Roman\r\n\n<u>Assets</u>\r\nTanuki Digital-Pagodas\r\nHovl Studio \r\nJean Moreno\r\nFlexUnit
    \r\nGabrielAguiarProductions\r\nSadouzz\nH I P E R N T\nKevin Iglesias\r\nNickLadd\r
    \nJonathan Rodriguez (Deus Ludus)\n\r\n<u>Sounds</u>\nfreesounds.org\n\n<u>Play
    testers\r</u>\nLuciano Bermudez\r\nRyan Stewart\r\nBrandon Saintol\nChristian
    Paul\n\n<u>Music</u>\nRed Horizon TAO\r\nSilence of the Warrior\r\nWar Drums
    Music\r\nRAIK\u014C \r\nHigh quality, royalty free: elevator music -Nassau of
    Lyrailie\n\nSPECIAL THANKS TO MR. G and our CLASS OF 2026 IT ACADEMY\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nTHANKS
    FOR PLAYING!\n\nFrom Nothing Else Matters Studios"
